WEBVTT

00:07:28.901 --> 00:07:31.811
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:07:31.811 --> 00:07:34.517
Yep, you guessed it. He threw tennis balls

00:07:34.517 --> 00:07:37.779
to all the neighborhood dogs, analyzed the saliva,

00:07:37.779 --> 00:07:41.673
identified the dog, and confronted the dog owner.

00:07:41.673 --> 00:07:47.949
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:07:47.949 --> 00:07:51.253
I discovered an invasive species in my own backyard.

00:07:51.253 --> 00:07:53.193
Looked like a ladybug, right?

00:07:53.193 --> 00:07:55.241
It actually is a Japanese beetle.

00:07:55.241 --> 00:07:57.152
And the same kind of technology --

00:07:57.152 --> 00:07:59.236
it's called DNA barcoding, it's really cool --

00:07:59.236 --> 00:08:04.102
You can use it to check if your caviar is really beluga,